icture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force Conduit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Conduit_(Condition)\" title=\"Force Conduit (Condition)\">Force Conduit</a> to remain active. All entities with or in this aura have their <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">movement speed</a> halved. \n</p><p>You must toggle this on in order to activate this condition.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Rampart_Aura\"> Condition: Rampart Aura </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rampart_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Rampart Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source src